{"parentUuid":"b03d0973-ff61-492e-a99e-360ac35fa49d","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"environment","snapshot":{"workingDirectory":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","isWorktree":false,"isGitRepo":true,"additionalWorkingDirectories":[],"platform":"darwin","shell":"zsh","osVersion":"Darwin 27.0.0","scratchpadDirectory":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-guygouri-Devlab-ernlang-ern/c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180/scratchpad"},"changes":[{"field":"workingDirectory","from":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"c5e88831-b19f-411f-9ff7-677ca32d5dfa","timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:47:32.288Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n# Environment update\n - Primary working directory: /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern (was /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal)\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","sessionId":"c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"formal/refinement_0.1","slug":"effervescent-gathering-wind"}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180","hash":"55921627e1b439078ca0fcbecbe6d4e52e278143ee87d1a7ccaffbc1187414de","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"R6 compiles for every operation in K4's scope, and all 68 theorems stay within {propext, Quot.sound}. Committing step 3."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01CoHjycoUEdHhfCdACtCtdn","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='Ern/MM23.lean'\ns=open(p).read()\nanchor=\"/-! ## Smoke test -/\"\nadd='''/-- R6 for `exitFrame` on the reached states (MM-03.3 §9.2, §10), under `DDSound k`: `WF3` and\n`FrameOwnedLive` hold there. -/\ntheorem r6_exit_reachable {k : K} {statics : Statics} {C : Nat → Nat → Prop}\n    {ObR : MM02.ReadOblSpec} {ObW : MM02.WriteOblSpec} {tok : Nat → Nat} {L : Layout}\n    {s3 s3' : S3} {s2 : MM02.State} (hdd : DDSound k) (hr : Reachable k statics s3)\n    (hR : Repr tok L s3 s2) (htc : TokCompat C tok) (h : ExitStep k s3 (.ok s3')) :\n    AllOk C ObR ObW s2 (exitOps L tok s3) ∧ Repr tok L s3' (exec s2 (exitOps L tok s3)) :=\n  r6_exit (reachable_invariants hdd hr).1 (reachable_fpLeaves_frameOwnedLive hdd hr).2 hR htc h\n\n'''\ns=s.replace(anchor, add+anchor)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\n~/.elan/bin/lake build 2>&1 | grep -E \"warning|error|Build\" | head; cd .. && grep -rnE '\\b(sorry|admit|native_decide)\\b|^\\s*axiom\\b' --include='*.lean' --exclude-dir=.lake .; git checkout formal/Ern/.gitkeep 2>/dev/null; git add formal/Ern/MM23.lean && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nMM23 pass 1, step 3: R6 for the operations in the scope of K4\n\nWhy: MM-03.3 §9.2 R6 asks that each concrete effect of a safe MM-03 step\nbe an authorised MM-02 transition; K4 fixes the correspondence.\n\nWhat:\n- r6_read3 (reads), r2_write3/r2_writeShared (writes, step 2).\n- r6_alloc: one-root shape (O14) -> one AllocStep at the placement;\n  r6_alloc_fail: no step, Repr kept.\n- r6_free: one DeallocStep of the root's allocation, under the contract\n  obligation FreeSound (FreeCompat -> MM-02 Compatible).\n- r6_enter: one AllocStep per root local with the new frame's token.\n- r6_exit (+ _reachable): one DeallocStep per root owned by the exited\n  frame, token compatible by construction (TokCompat); owned storage\n  that dies with the frame keeps a live allocation.\n- r6_noStep: derive, split, release, depend, endUse, pin, unpin,\n  newArena, reset map to no step and keep Repr.\n- Support: exists_leaf, rootAlloc, deallocOps, repr_deallocs,\n  Repr.shrink, exec_wf.\n\nHow proved: lake build clean; no sorry/admit/axiom/native_decide; the 69\ntheorems use at most propext and Quot.sound.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1","description":"Add the exit corollary, build, commit step 3"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
