{"parentUuid":"625ceff3-db99-451e-8df3-373c999bb9a3","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"edited_text_file","filename":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal/Ern/MM03/LockOptions.lean","snippet":""},"type":"attachment","uuid":"419bcdbe-a28b-42e2-86db-e605d6da1dc4","timestamp":"2026-11-01T18:17:45.623Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nNote: /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal/Ern/MM03/LockOptions.lean changed on disk since you last read it. That's usually deliberate, so take it as the current state rather than reverting it; if the change looks wrong, say so rather than undoing it yourself — otherwise no need to call it out. The changes are not shown here; use Read if you need the current content.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","sessionId":"c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"formal/validation_0.1","slug":"effervescent-gathering-wind"}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180","hash":"89fba23aa974909af5fcb10556eb34480e7eba7f6f35ab7508d6e51119b8c7c9","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01SBYxoGitjo1aVvwZP9NqYS","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='Ern/MM03/LockOptions.lean'\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace('''/-- Self-lock of the authority `a` (material §5, options 2 and 3): `a` is active and held by a place\none of whose leaves it covers. -/\ndef SelfLock (s : S3) (a : Nat) : Prop :=\n  OptP (s.A[a]?) (fun y => y.active = true ∧ match y.holder with\n    | .place p => ∃ l ∈ y.footprint, l ∈ footprint s.P p\n    | .frame _ => False) False\n\ninstance (s : S3) (a : Nat) : Decidable (SelfLock s a) := by\n  unfold SelfLock OptP; split\n  · rename_i y _; cases y.holder <;> infer_instance\n  · infer_instance''','''/-- The leaves of a holder (MM-03.3.4): those of a place, none for a frame. -/\ndef holderLeaves (s : S3) : Holder → List Nat\n  | .place p => footprint s.P p\n  | .frame _ => []\n\n/-- Self-lock of the authority `a` (material §5, options 2 and 3): `a` is active and held by a place\none of whose leaves it covers. -/\ndef SelfLock (s : S3) (a : Nat) : Prop :=\n  OptP (s.A[a]?) (fun y => y.active = true ∧ ∃ l ∈ y.footprint, l ∈ holderLeaves s y.holder) False\n\ninstance (s : S3) (a : Nat) : Decidable (SelfLock s a) := by unfold SelfLock; infer_instance''')\ns=s.replace('''def Blocks (s : S3) (b a : Nat) : Prop :=\n  b ≠ a ∧ s.Active b ∧ s.Active a ∧ OptP (s.A[a]?) (fun y => match y.holder with\n    | .place p => ∃ l ∈ s.afp b, l ∈ footprint s.P p\n    | .frame _ => False) False\n\ninstance (s : S3) (b a : Nat) : Decidable (Blocks s b a) := by\n  unfold Blocks OptP; split\n  · rename_i y _; cases y.holder <;> infer_instance\n  · infer_instance''','''def Blocks (s : S3) (b a : Nat) : Prop :=\n  b ≠ a ∧ s.Active b ∧ s.Active a ∧\n    OptP (s.A[a]?) (fun y => ∃ l ∈ s.afp b, l ∈ holderLeaves s y.holder) False\n\ninstance (s : S3) (b a : Nat) : Decidable (Blocks s b a) := by unfold Blocks; infer_instance''')\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nsrc=s\ni=src.index('/-- Every run of the list is `ok`')\nt=src[:i]+'''\n#eval mustAccept.all (fun c => (prun K0 (PS.init []) c.2).isSome)\n#eval mustAccept.map (fun c => (c.1, dec2 c.2))\n#eval mustAccept.map (fun c => (c.1, dec3 c.2))\n#eval (dec2 h49o, dec3 h49o, dec2 h50ao, dec3 h50ao, dec2 h50bo, dec3 h50bo, dec2 h51o, dec3 h51o)\nend Ern.MM03.LockOptions\n'''\nopen('/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-guygouri-Devlab-ernlang-ern/c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180/scratchpad/j3/lo.lean','w').write(t)\nEOF\nSP=/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-guygouri-Devlab-ernlang-ern/c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180/scratchpad; time ~/.elan/bin/lake env lean $SP/j3/lo.lean 2>&1 | head -40","description":"Simplify predicates and evaluate decisions","timeout":600000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
