{"parentUuid":"c2b5922c-eba9-4531-bca6-6b6b6b6ebf56","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgcfrcRFLVnZJgEVKYXCk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01UDoW2bp17W59rrQcZMAZHU","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git checkout formal/Ern/.gitkeep 2>/dev/null; git status --short && git add formal/Ern/MM03/LockOptions.lean formal/Ern/MM03/Horrors.lean && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nJ3 step 4: measure of the NoLock options\n\nWhy: the jalon-3 material (§5) asks, for options 2 and 3, the false\nrejections on the cases that must be accepted, the residual blockings on\nH49-H51 and the cost of the check, without adopting an option.\n\nWhat: new module Ern.MM03.LockOptions. Option 2: SelfLock (an active\nauthority covering a leaf of its holder), checked on the arrival of\ntransfer and issue (store left to O8.3). Option 3: Blocks (\"b blocks a\":\ndistinct, active, footprint of b meets the holder of a), self-lock as a\nseparate clause, BlocksAcyclic by bounded reachability, checked on the\narrival of transfer, issue and store. decisions evaluates an option on\neach checked step of a case's run, on the state where it runs.\nObtained: no false rejection for either option on H11, H19, H29b,\nH35-H37, H44-H47, W1-W3; option 2 prevents H50 only, option 3 prevents\nH49, H50 and H51. Option 2 is local (opt2_transfer_local,\nopt2_issue_local); option 3 is not (opt3_not_local: same stored\nauthority and target, different verdicts). MM03/Horrors: the inline runs\nmeasured here are named (no statement changed).\n\nProof: lake build succeeds without warnings; the 53 constants of the\nmodule depend only on propext and Quot.sound.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1; SP=/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-guygouri-Devlab-ernlang-ern/c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180/scratchpad; cat >> $SP/j3/log.md <<'EOF'\n8. Step 4 done: LockOptions. Both options: no false rejection on the must-accept list. Option 2\n   prevents H50 only (local); option 3 prevents H49 (closing store), H50, H51 (cycle root-of-storage\n   / view) and is not local. Inline runs of MM03/Horrors named for reuse.\nEOF","description":"Commit step 4 and log","timeout":300000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1163,"cache_read_input_tokens":726365,"output_tokens":936,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1163,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":936,"cache_read_input_tokens":726365,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1163,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1163},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01UDoW2bp17W59rrQcZMAZHU":{"command":"cd /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern && git checkout formal/Ern/.gitkeep 2>/dev/null; git status --short && git add formal/Ern/MM03/LockOptions.lean formal/Ern/MM03/Horrors.lean && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nJ3 step 4: measure of the NoLock options\n\nWhy: the jalon-3 material (§5) asks, for options 2 and 3, the false\nrejections on the cases that must be accepted, the residual blockings on\nH49-H51 and the cost of the check, without adopting an option.\n\nWhat: new module Ern.MM03.LockOptions. Option 2: SelfLock (an active\nauthority covering a leaf of its holder), checked on the arrival of\ntransfer and issue (store left to O8.3). Option 3: Blocks (\"b blocks a\":\ndistinct, active, footprint of b meets the holder of a), self-lock as a\nseparate clause, BlocksAcyclic by bounded reachability, checked on the\narrival of transfer, issue and store. decisions evaluates an option on\neach checked step of a case's run, on the state where it runs.\nObtained: no false rejection for either option on H11, H19, H29b,\nH35-H37, H44-H47, W1-W3; option 2 prevents H50 only, option 3 prevents\nH49, H50 and H51. Option 2 is local (opt2_transfer_local,\nopt2_issue_local); option 3 is not (opt3_not_local: same stored\nauthority and target, different verdicts). MM03/Horrors: the inline runs\nmeasured here are named (no statement changed).\n\nProof: lake build succeeds without warnings; the 53 constants of the\nmodule depend only on propext and Quot.sound.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1; SP=/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-guygouri-Devlab-ernlang-ern/c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180/scratchpad; cat >> $SP/j3/log.md <<'EOF'\n8. Step 4 done: LockOptions. Both options: no false rejection on the must-accept list. Option 2\n   prevents H50 only (local); option 3 prevents H49 (closing store), H50, H51 (cycle root-of-storage\n   / view) and is not local. Inline runs of MM03/Horrors named for reuse.\nEOF","description":"Commit step 4 and log","timeout":300000}},"wireIngestContext":{"toolu_01UDoW2bp17W59rrQcZMAZHU":{"cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"66694ed7-b02f-49e6-b651-31977d033f30","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cgcfrc4AbXjgouv7jvZso","requestRef":"4eef7dce-4059-47c3-90ba-a9f5784191c6","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"f14f9735-4b47-489e-8b91-a25b6200d11c","timestamp":"2026-11-01T18:20:21.810Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","sessionId":"c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"formal/validation_0.1","slug":"effervescent-gathering-wind"}
