{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180","hash":"de66b894ed1b1b9430c3b0d23191f95bd48d628b0fbd5855d8c6a6bcb15babd5","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01UDoW2bp17W59rrQcZMAZHU","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern && git checkout formal/Ern/.gitkeep 2>/dev/null; git status --short && git add formal/Ern/MM03/LockOptions.lean formal/Ern/MM03/Horrors.lean && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nJ3 step 4: measure of the NoLock options\n\nWhy: the jalon-3 material (§5) asks, for options 2 and 3, the false\nrejections on the cases that must be accepted, the residual blockings on\nH49-H51 and the cost of the check, without adopting an option.\n\nWhat: new module Ern.MM03.LockOptions. Option 2: SelfLock (an active\nauthority covering a leaf of its holder), checked on the arrival of\ntransfer and issue (store left to O8.3). Option 3: Blocks (\"b blocks a\":\ndistinct, active, footprint of b meets the holder of a), self-lock as a\nseparate clause, BlocksAcyclic by bounded reachability, checked on the\narrival of transfer, issue and store. decisions evaluates an option on\neach checked step of a case's run, on the state where it runs.\nObtained: no false rejection for either option on H11, H19, H29b,\nH35-H37, H44-H47, W1-W3; option 2 prevents H50 only, option 3 prevents\nH49, H50 and H51. Option 2 is local (opt2_transfer_local,\nopt2_issue_local); option 3 is not (opt3_not_local: same stored\nauthority and target, different verdicts). MM03/Horrors: the inline runs\nmeasured here are named (no statement changed).\n\nProof: lake build succeeds without warnings; the 53 constants of the\nmodule depend only on propext and Quot.sound.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1; SP=/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-guygouri-Devlab-ernlang-ern/c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180/scratchpad; cat >> $SP/j3/log.md <<'EOF'\n8. Step 4 done: LockOptions. Both options: no false rejection on the must-accept list. Option 2\n   prevents H50 only (local); option 3 prevents H49 (closing store), H50, H51 (cycle root-of-storage\n   / view) and is not local. Inline runs of MM03/Horrors named for reuse.\nEOF","description":"Commit step 4 and log","timeout":300000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
