{"parentUuid":"de246c02-e1b8-46f5-90a6-17d4d18b6e31","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"72e6e280-2a83-43a7-9bea-509469527d06","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01De63D8Hf23LovpbJmMedNA","type":"tool_result","content":"1\timport Ern.MM03.Horrors\n2\t\n3\t/-!\n4\t# Measure of the `NoLock` options (jalon 3, step 4)\n5\t\n6\tThe options of the jalon-3 material (`ERN_Jalon3_materiel.md` v2, §5), measured on the kernel as it\n7\tis (option 1, no rule), without modifying it:\n8\t\n9\t* option 2, a local rule: an operation does not place an authority into a place it covers\n10\t  (`SelfLock`); `store` already rejects it (O8.3), so the rule is measured on `transfer` and\n11\t  `issue` (`opt2`);\n12\t* option 3, `NoLock`: no self-lock, as a separate clause, and the relation \"`b` blocks `a`\"\n13\t  (`Blocks`) acyclic, checked on the arrival state of `transfer`, `issue` and `store` (`opt3`).\n14\t\n15\tFor each case of the list \"doit être accepté\" of §5 (H11, H19, H29b, H35 to H37, H44 to H47, W1\n16\tto W3) and for H49 to H51, `decisions` gives the decision of an option on each `transfer`, `issue`\n17\tand `store` of the run of the case (`Ern.MM03.Horrors`), decided on the state where the step runs;\n18\t`true` is acceptance. The cost: option 2 is decided from the authorities the operation moves and the\n19\tplaces that receive them (`opt2_transfer_local`); option 3 is not, the decision depends on\n20\tauthorities the operation does not touch (`opt3_not_local`). No option is adopted (material §5:\n21\t\"la décision revient à l'arbitrage\").\n22\t-/\n23\t\n24\tnamespace Ern.MM03.LockOptions\n25\t\n26\topen Ern.MM03 Ern.HandlePool Ern.MM03.Horrors\n27\t\n28\t/-! ## Option 2: self-lock -/\n29\t\n30\t/-- The leaves of a holder (MM-03.3.4): those of a place, none for a frame. -/"}]},"uuid":"16195c9c-92fb-4295-acb0-6ad3ba44e092","timestamp":"2026-11-01T18:27:48.168Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal/Ern/MM03/LockOptions.lean","content":"import Ern.MM03.Horrors\n\n/-!\n# Measure of the `NoLock` options (jalon 3, step 4)\n\nThe options of the jalon-3 material (`ERN_Jalon3_materiel.md` v2, §5), measured on the kernel as it\nis (option 1, no rule), without modifying it:\n\n* option 2, a local rule: an operation does not place an authority into a place it covers\n  (`SelfLock`); `store` already rejects it (O8.3), so the rule is measured on `transfer` and\n  `issue` (`opt2`);\n* option 3, `NoLock`: no self-lock, as a separate clause, and the relation \"`b` blocks `a`\"\n  (`Blocks`) acyclic, checked on the arrival state of `transfer`, `issue` and `store` (`opt3`).\n\nFor each case of the list \"doit être accepté\" of §5 (H11, H19, H29b, H35 to H37, H44 to H47, W1\nto W3) and for H49 to H51, `decisions` gives the decision of an option on each `transfer`, `issue`\nand `store` of the run of the case (`Ern.MM03.Horrors`), decided on the state where the step runs;\n`true` is acceptance. The cost: option 2 is decided from the authorities the operation moves and the\nplaces that receive them (`opt2_transfer_local`); option 3 is not, the decision depends on\nauthorities the operation does not touch (`opt3_not_local`). No option is adopted (material §5:\n\"la décision revient à l'arbitrage\").\n-/\n\nnamespace Ern.MM03.LockOptions\n\nopen Ern.MM03 Ern.HandlePool Ern.MM03.Horrors\n\n/-! ## Option 2: self-lock -/\n\n/-- The leaves of a holder (MM-03.3.4): those of a place, none for a frame. -/","numLines":30,"startLine":1,"totalLines":259}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"de246c02-e1b8-46f5-90a6-17d4d18b6e31","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","sessionId":"c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"formal/validation_0.1","slug":"effervescent-gathering-wind"}
