{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180","hash":"a063c0bd74c94b77236d458072fa94503a548a95219f163ccb5eac3b2ea30d07","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The MM23-H review surfaced eight valid issues (no blockers), including wrong-reason proofs, weaker-than-expected results, missing persistence after reset, and an unused `paramsOf`. I'll fix the LockOptions and MM23/Horrors modules now, leaving HandlePool and MM03/Horrors until their reviews complete.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Ec966tVCsUbtRBfi1WXRur","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal && grep -n 'theorem along_append' -A3 Ern/MM23.lean; grep -n 'KNS' Ern/MM03.lean | head; grep -n 'theorem alloc_det' Ern/MM03.lean","description":"Locate along_append and KNS instances"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
