e run, the block ended with its value 2. -/","+def h17t : PS := run KF4 [] (h17p ++ [.issue 0 0 [5] 2, .endUse 2])","+/-- Contracts declaring deallocable, with the authority 7, both the storage 4 and the region 5. -/","+abbrev KF45 : K := KT [] [] [] [4, 5] [(4, 7), (5, 7)]","+def h17d : PS := run KF45 [] (h17p ++ [.issue 0 0 [5] 2])"," "," /-- **H17** (C; A6, `Deallocable`; Lib; covered pass 2). `free` of the block on `[5]`: rejected,","-the region is a part of the storage, neither an owned root nor deallocable. Expected: reject;","-obtained: reject. Twin: `free` of the allocated storage 4 itself, with nothing issued, accepted. -/","-theorem H17 : PReach KF4 [] h17 ∧ FreeStep KF4 5 7 h17.s .reject ∧ PReach KF4 [] h17t ∧","-    FreeStep KF4 4 7 h17t.s (.ok (freeEff h17t.s 4)) :=","+the region is a part of the storage, not an owned root, nor deallocable under `KF4`; with the region","+declared deallocable (`KF45`), the `free` is still rejected (`OwnedRoot`). Expected: reject;","+obtained: reject. Twin: in the same run, the block ended, the `free` of the allocated storage 4 is","+accepted. -/","+theorem H17 : PReach KF4 [] h17 ∧ FreeStep KF4 5 7 h17.s .reject ∧","+    PReach KF45 [] h17d ∧ ¬ OwnedRoot h17d.s 5 ∧ FreeStep KF45 5 7 h17d.s .reject ∧","+    PReach KF4 [] h17t ∧ FreeStep KF4 4 7 h17t.s (.ok (freeEff h17t.s 4)) :=","   ⟨run_reach (by decide) (by decide), .reject (by decide), run_reach (by decide) (by decide),","-    .ok (by decide)⟩","+    by decide, .reject (by decide), run_reach (by decide) (by decide), .ok (by decide)⟩"," "," /-! ## D. Arenas -/"," "]},{"oldStart":388,"oldLines":12,"newStart":397,"newLines":12,"lines":[" /-- **H22** (E; A8; N3; covered pass 2). The transfer of a value whose in-place leaf is pinned is"," rejected; the transfer of a value whose owned storage only is pinned is accepted. Expected:"," reject / `ok`; obtained: the same. Twin of the rejection: without the pin, accepted. -/","-theorem H22 : PReach K0 [] h22 ∧ TransferStep K0 0 1 h22.s .reject ∧","+theorem H22 : PReach K0 [] h22 ∧ TransferStep K0 0 1 h22.s .reject ∧ PReach K0 [] h22t ∧","     TransferStep K0 0 1 h22t.s (.ok (transferEff h22t.s 0 1)) ∧","     PReach K0 [] (run K0 [] [.enter [] [lf, lf, lf], .write 0 [0], .write 1 [1], .alloc 0 1 [lf],","       .pin 3, .transfer 1 2]) :=","-  ⟨run_reach (by decide) (by decide), .reject (by decide), .ok (by decide),","-    run_reach (by decide) (by decide)⟩","+  ⟨run_reach (by decide) (by decide), .reject (by decide), run_reach (by decide) (by decide),","+    .ok (by decide), run_reach (by decide) (by decide)⟩"," "," /-- H23: frame 1 calls frame 2 with the local 1, pinned. -/"," def h23 : PS := run K0 [] [.enter [] [lf], .enter [] [lf], .pin 1]"]},{"oldStart":752,"oldLines":8,"newStart":761,"newLines":9,"lines":["   .alloc 0 1 [lf, (some 2, none, 0)], .derive 1 1 .observe]"," "," /-- **H51** (I; §5; N3). An element of a storage owned by `v` holds a view on `v`. The direct `store`","-is rejected by its arrival clause (G2); with a helper on the storage, then its `release`, it is","-reached. Then `v` can be neither written, ended by `endUse`, nor relieved of the view (`release`","+is rejected: the view already takes away the frame's `Modify` on `v`, hence on the storage `v` owns","+(`HasRight` before the step, B2), and the arrival clause of G2 fails too; with a helper on the","+storage, then its `release`, the configuration is reached. Then `v` can be neither written, ended by `endUse`, nor relieved of the view (`release`"," rejected), while the view stays exercisable at `Observe`; the exit of the frame releases it."," Expected: to arbitrate (§5); obtained: `ok`, with a residual blocking until the exit. -/"," theorem H51 : PReach K0 [] h51n ∧ StoreStep 3 3 h51n.s .reject ∧ PReach K0 [] h51 ∧"]},{"oldStart":813,"oldLines":12,"newStart":823,"newLines":13,"lines":[" def w2 : PS := run K0 [] w2o"," def w2a : PS := run K0 [] (w2o ++ [.release 12])"," ","-/-- **W2** (§5b, ECS archetype and sparse set; 