{"parentUuid":"bc95e8c3-38cf-4ee8-b7d1-fafabdc4b44b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgchDcbMaxQzPMsj7M597","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01WbbiakEPijyL2GCUxuuN26","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git checkout formal/Ern/.gitkeep 2>/dev/null; git add formal/Ern/HandlePool.lean formal/Ern/MM03/Horrors.lean formal/Ern/MM03/LockOptions.lean formal/Ern/MM23/Horrors.lean formal/reports/J3_v0.1.md && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nJ3: review fixes and report\n\nWhy: four adversarial reviews (pool exclusivity and fidelity, MM3-H\ntwins, NoLock measure, MM23-H) found wording errors, two cases weaker\nthan expected, one witness outside the option's domain, and spec points\nof the pool contract to report.\n\nWhat:\n- MM3-H: H51 and H07 docstrings corrected; H17 minimal twin and the\n  region declared deallocable; W3 variant keeps the stored views; H01\n  reborrow and W2 stated as expected vs obtained; twin reached in H22;\n  section of witnesses on the pool contract (freeSlot on a derived\n  internal or with a writeShared right, two pools on one internal,\n  arena on a pool's internal, free entry handle, Init content).\n- MM23-H: step_ok_of (R6 at one step); H04 bytes initialised and\n  read-then-write; H05, H07, H09 ok per step; H06 rejected by OwnedRoot\n  with the region deallocable; H02 persistence (reset_kills_blocks_after);\n  H07 fail on a state reached under KNS; H10 at every prefix.\n- LockOptions: opt3_not_local on two states where the kernel accepts the\n  store; cost reading stated; H49 and H51 docstrings; W3 variant decisions.\n- HandlePool: allocSlotEff docstring states the content is unchanged.\n- Report formal/reports/J3_v0.1.md, sections (a)-(g) and the review.\n\nProof: lake build succeeds without warnings; every constant of the four\nnew modules depends only on propext and Quot.sound.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1","description":"Commit review fixes and the report","timeout":300000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9513,"cache_read_input_tokens":850419,"output_tokens":1054,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":183},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":9513,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1054,"cache_read_input_tokens":850419,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9513,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":9513},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01WbbiakEPijyL2GCUxuuN26":{"command":"cd /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern && git checkout formal/Ern/.gitkeep 2>/dev/null; git add formal/Ern/HandlePool.lean formal/Ern/MM03/Horrors.lean formal/Ern/MM03/LockOptions.lean formal/Ern/MM23/Horrors.lean formal/reports/J3_v0.1.md && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nJ3: review fixes and report\n\nWhy: four adversarial reviews (pool exclusivity and fidelity, MM3-H\ntwins, NoLock measure, MM23-H) found wording errors, two cases weaker\nthan expected, one witness outside the option's domain, and spec points\nof the pool contract to report.\n\nWhat:\n- MM3-H: H51 and H07 docstrings corrected; H17 minimal twin and the\n  region declared deallocable; W3 variant keeps the stored views; H01\n  reborrow and W2 stated as expected vs obtained; twin reached in H22;\n  section of witnesses on the pool contract (freeSlot on a derived\n  internal or with a writeShared right, two pools on one internal,\n  arena on a pool's internal, free entry handle, Init content).\n- MM23-H: step_ok_of (R6 at one step); H04 bytes initialised and\n  read-then-write; H05, H07, H09 ok per step; H06 rejected by OwnedRoot\n  with the region deallocable; H02 persistence (reset_kills_blocks_after);\n  H07 fail on a state reached under KNS; H10 at every prefix.\n- LockOptions: opt3_not_local on two states where the kernel accepts the\n  store; cost reading stated; H49 and H51 docstrings; W3 variant decisions.\n- HandlePool: allocSlotEff docstring states the content is unchanged.\n- Report formal/reports/J3_v0.1.md, sections (a)-(g) and the review.\n\nProof: lake build succeeds without warnings; every constant of the four\nnew modules depends only on propext and Quot.sound.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1","description":"Commit review fixes and the report","timeout":300000}},"wireIngestContext":{"toolu_01WbbiakEPijyL2GCUxuuN26":{"cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"091de366-ade1-4476-a5a6-3ce15640b64f","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgchDc6M8j76xhqkGuGD1","requestRef":"5cfdad40-950e-4890-bc06-79bcfa91a750","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"b47a2a79-c445-426c-b8ef-7d80b7801c7b","timestamp":"2026-11-01T18:38:14.325Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","sessionId":"c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"formal/validation_0.1","slug":"effervescent-gathering-wind"}
