{"parentUuid":"8b5f06c3-6bd3-4b0d-b043-c796c085b493","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgcinwGYd3iKFbm9p8vXo","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01KBuYyJHTgnJSn57oDQCRGH","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='formal/reports/J3_v0.1.md'\ns=open(p).read()\nfor a,b in [(\"  - `MM03.Horrors` : 175 constantes, dont 67 théorèmes ;\",\"  - `MM03.Horrors` : 177 constantes, dont 68 théorèmes ;\"),\n            (\"  - `MM23.Horrors` : 223 constantes, dont 120 théorèmes ;\",\"  - `MM23.Horrors` : 227 constantes, dont 120 théorèmes ;\")]:\n    assert a in s, a\n    s=s.replace(a,b)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ngit checkout formal/Ern/.gitkeep 2>/dev/null; git status --short; git add formal/Ern/MM03/Horrors.lean formal/Ern/MM03/LockOptions.lean formal/Ern/MM23/Horrors.lean formal/reports/J3_v0.1.md && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nJ3: second check fixes\n\nWhy: a second targeted check (four checkers, one refuter per finding)\nconfirmed 13 of 15 findings on the review fixes and the report.\n\nWhat:\n- MM23-H01 encoded with DeclaredDisjoint instantiated by leaf\n  disjointness (decision 1, as a K parameter); byte disjointness of\n  declared regions proved on the translated state (byteDisjoint_of_leaves).\n- MM23-H06 states reached under its own contract, with a twin; MM23-H02\n  twin; MM3-H03 twin reached.\n- W2: witness that releasing one column view is not enough under either\n  reading (w2b); report (b) 3 and (g) 6 rewritten.\n- transfer_rejected_by_frame_held: general lemma behind report (b) 1.\n- Docstrings: pool_freeSlot_derived_internal scoped to its pool;\n  LockOptions quotation attributed to the task.\n- Report: MM23-H table gains source, class and twin; H38 stated not\n  expressible; option 2 locality qualified; (g) 2 and (g) 12 scoped;\n  (f) renumbered with the class of W1-W3; second check summarized.\n\nProof: lake build succeeds without warnings; every constant of the four\nnew modules depends only on propext and Quot.sound; MM02, MM03 and MM23\nunchanged since formal/refinement_0.1.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -8","description":"Commit second-check fixes","timeout":300000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":744,"cache_read_input_tokens":910037,"output_tokens":983,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":744,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":983,"cache_read_input_tokens":910037,"cache_creation_input_tokens":744,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":744},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01KBuYyJHTgnJSn57oDQCRGH":{"command":"cd /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='formal/reports/J3_v0.1.md'\ns=open(p).read()\nfor a,b in [(\"  - `MM03.Horrors` : 175 constantes, dont 67 théorèmes ;\",\"  - `MM03.Horrors` : 177 constantes, dont 68 théorèmes ;\"),\n            (\"  - `MM23.Horrors` : 223 constantes, dont 120 théorèmes ;\",\"  - `MM23.Horrors` : 227 constantes, dont 120 théorèmes ;\")]:\n    assert a in s, a\n    s=s.replace(a,b)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ngit checkout formal/Ern/.gitkeep 2>/dev/null; git status --short; git add formal/Ern/MM03/Horrors.lean formal/Ern/MM03/LockOptions.lean formal/Ern/MM23/Horrors.lean formal/reports/J3_v0.1.md && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nJ3: second check fixes\n\nWhy: a second targeted check (four checkers, one refuter per finding)\nconfirmed 13 of 15 findings on the review fixes and the report.\n\nWhat:\n- MM23-H01 encoded w