{"parentUuid":"eec2a429-977a-42a9-b925-3ed730241bd0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgcjj7LHiukCSD2A47x2j","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The third check confirms nine findings and refutes none. The main one: W2 kept system A's column authority active through the move, which the scenario doesn't call for. With A's column released after its write, only B's view is active at the move; the expected verdict is then obtained if \"the view\" means B's column authority, and not if it means the read view. I'll rebuild W2 that way. The other eight:\n- minimal twins for MM23-H06 and H02;\n- a per-row class column in the MM23-H table;\n- one source to correct (H08);\n- two overstated phrases in the report;\n- a wrong example in a lemma docstring.\n\nChecking which arbitrage MM23 cites for the leak case before changing the H08 source."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3257,"cache_read_input_tokens":915357,"output_tokens":2353,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1964},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3257,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":2353,"cache_read_input_tokens":915357,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3257,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3257},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"cc4bde63-fdc5-469d-ac06-5a3357246850","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cgcjj6iqME9dLgpihhePt","requestRef":"1b57fabd-91e4-4e41-b04d-b767271b2265","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"c3a04191-00d6-43f3-b5e8-152320e7e5bf","timestamp":"2026-11-