{"parentUuid":"645dfab3-b8d3-49b1-a642-2d5266026e16","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgcjudoPjutUTUcXZGQza","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The table columns are correct, and the counts and axioms are clean. Committing the third-check fixes."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":680,"cache_read_input_tokens":930926,"output_tokens":877,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":181},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":680,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":877,"cache_read_input_tokens":930926,"cache_creation_input_tokens":680,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":680},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"2d31efcd-21ef-44fa-9d56-d5dbed443cb6","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgcjudSZfbK2pmB9f9f9d","requestRef":"fcfbd387-cae7-4fc3-b0c6-616583aa262c","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"f97d4394-3067-4ecd-8cff-cc8d0639969a","timestamp":"2026-11-01T19:13:24.672Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","sessionId":"c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"formal/validation_0.1","slug":"effervescent-gathering-wind"}
{"parentUuid":"f97d4394-3067-4ecd-8cff-cc8d0639969a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgcjudoPjutUTUcXZGQza","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Mtw8gD1tMwTyufnpac8JbQ","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern && git checkout formal/Ern/.gitkeep 2>/dev/null; git add formal/Ern/MM03/Horrors.lean formal/Ern/MM03/LockOptions.lean formal/Ern/MM23/Horrors.lean formal/reports/J3_v0.1.md && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nJ3: third check fixes\n\nWhy: a third check of the second-round fixes confirmed 9 findings, among\nthem that W2 kept system A's column authority active through the move,\nwhich made the second round's \"rejected under either reading\" an\nartefact of the construction.\n\nWhat:\n- W2: system A releases its column authority after its write, so one\n  column view is active at the move. The expected verdict is obtained\n  when \"the view\" is B's column authority, not when it is the read view\n  alone (report (b) 3, (g) 6).\n- MM23-H06: rejection and twin on the same state, the block ended\n  (OwnedRoot alone fails); MM23-H02 twin is the run without the end of\n  the block.\n- Report: per-row class in the MM23-H table (H14 spec 3, H17 specs 4 and\n  11), H08 source K3 and K4, §9.2 sources named, byte disjointness of\n  MM23-H01 scoped to regions of leaves; third check summarized.\n- transfer_rejected_by_frame_held docstring no longer cites H07.\n\nProof: lake build succeeds without warnings; every constant of the four\nnew modules depends only on propext and Quot.sound.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1","description":"Commit third-check fixes","timeout":300000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":680,"cache_read_input_tokens":930926,"output_tokens":877,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":181},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":680,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":877,"cache_read_input_tokens":930926,"cache_creation_input_tokens":680,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":680},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01Mtw8gD1tMwTyufnpac8JbQ":{"command":"cd /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern && git checkout formal/Ern/.gitkeep 2>/dev/null; git add formal/Ern/MM03/Horrors.lean formal/Ern/MM03/LockOptions.lean formal/Ern/MM23/Horrors.lean formal/reports/J3_v0.1.md && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nJ3: third check fixes\n\nWhy: a third check of the second-round fixes confirmed 9 findings, among\nthem that W2 kept system A's column authority active through the move,\nwhich made the second round's \"rejected under either reading\" an\nartefact of the construction.\n\nWhat:\n- W2: system A releases its column authority after its write, so one\n  column view is active at the move. The expected verdict is obtained\n  when \"the view\" is B's column authority, not when it is the read view\n  alone (report (b) 3, (g) 6).\n- MM23-H06: rejection and twin on the same state, the block ended\n  (OwnedRoot alone fails); MM23-H02 twin is the run without the end of\n  the block.\n- Report: per-row class in the MM23-H table (H14 spec 3, H17 specs 4 and\n  11), H08 source K3 and K4, §9.2 sources named, byte disjointness of\n  MM23-H01 scoped to regions of leaves; third check summarized.\n- transfer_rejected_by_frame_held docstring no longer cites H07.\n\nProof: lake build succeeds without warnings; every constant of the four\nnew modules depends only on propext and Quot.sound.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1","description":"Commit third-check fixes","timeout":300000}},"serverClassifierRequest":"2d31efcd-21ef-44fa-9d56-d5dbed443cb6","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgcjudSZfbK2pmB9f9f9d","requestRef":"fcfbd387-cae7-4fc3-b0c6-616583aa262c","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"d9a9e278-1be1-4d05-acb8-8e4781e7248a","timestamp":"2026-11-01T19:13:29.545Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","sessionId":"c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"formal/validation_0.1","slug":"effervescent-gathering-wind"}
