{"parentUuid":"60d70e18-f52c-4344-8fdc-f08dcc2986df","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgckW4ZN6Q65SLqKSBzaP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The fourth check confirms four findings and refutes one. The major one is broader than reported: a statement `PReach K0 [] (run K0 [] ops)` holds even when a step fails, because `run` then returns the initial state, which is reachable. Every proof did establish that the runs succeed (`run_reach` needs `isSome` by `decide`), but the statements don't record it. The same holds for `sst` in MM23-H. The fix is systematic:\n- a failed run now yields a state with no frame, which no run reaches;\n- new lemmas `run_ok_of_reach` and `sst_ok_of_reachable` turn any reachability conjunct into \"every step is ok\".\n\nThen the three smaller wording fixes."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2462,"cache_read_input_tokens":935574,"output_tokens":6029,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":5601},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2462,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":6029,"cache_read_input_tokens":935574,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2462,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2462},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"c7804184-d511-4957-b163-99c1fb933d92","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgckW3wuQz2FLeUDBLpVv","requestRef":"6cc64f36-92c0-47e0-9385-7bb48ae58790","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"54de9bbb-4fbd-45de-b1ce-2763745ae46b","timestamp":"2026-11-01T19:22:06.944Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5