{"parentUuid":"e0b96dc6-8100-4f56-9977-f241e5100227","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"fcfe6e6f-a978-46ba-b770-f92b3a29d346","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JBtWCXdhVWLASUwQ2WRBgh","type":"tool_result","content":"/-! ## Invariants (MM-03.3 §2, A1) -/\n\n/-- I1, effective exclusivity strengthened structurally (MM-03.3 §2, A1): two distinct active\nauthorities, unrelated by `origin`, covering the same leaf, `SharedMutable` leaves included,\nboth have the proper mode `Observe`. The pass-1 statement on effective modes is the theorem\n`effective_compat`. -/\ndef I1 (s : S3) : Prop :=\n  ∀ (a b : Nat) (x y : Authority) (p : Nat), a ≠ b → s.A[a]? = some x → s.A[b]? = some y →\n    x.active = true → y.active = true → p ∈ x.footprint → p ∈ y.footprint →\n    a ∉ s.ancs b → b ∉ s.ancs a → x.mode = .observe ∧ y.mode = .observe\n\n/-- I2, conservation of authorities (MM-03.3 §2): the origin of a derived authority exists, and\non each leaf of the derived footprint, the leaf is in the footprint of the origin and the\nderived mode does not exceed the origin's. -/\ndef I2 (s : S3) : Prop :=\n  ∀ (b : Nat) (y : Authority) (a : Nat), s.A[b]? = some y → y.origin = some a →\n    ∃ x : Authority, s.A[a]? = some x ∧ ∀ p ∈ y.footprint, p ∈ x.footprint ∧ y.mode.le x.mode\n\n/-- I3, validity of dependencies (MM-03.3 §2): every anchor of a usable place is valid, that is,\nactive (pass-1 arbitrage 2). -/\ndef I3 (s : S3) : Prop := ∀ q, s.Usable q → ∀ x ∈ s.D q, s.Active x\n\n/-- I4, validity of consumed values (MM-03.3 §2), first sentence as a state predicate: no","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"506eaa4b-82d6-4764-b9a9-1a0848621f7f","timestamp":"2026-11-03T13:46:17.888Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"/-! ## Invariants (MM-03.3 §2, A1) -/\n\n/-- I1, effective exclusivity strengthened structurally (MM-03.3 §2, A1): two distinct active\nauthorities, unrelated by `origin`, covering the same leaf, `SharedMutable` leaves included,\nboth have the proper mode `Observe`. The pass-1 statement on effective modes is the theorem\n`effective_compat`. -/\ndef I1 (s : S3) : Prop :=\n  ∀ (a b : Nat) (x y : Authority) (p : Nat), a ≠ b → s.A[a]? = some x → s.A[b]? = some y →\n    x.active = true → y.active = true → p ∈ x.footprint → p ∈ y.footprint →\n    a ∉ s.ancs b → b ∉ s.ancs a → x.mode = .observe ∧ y.mode = .observe\n\n/-- I2, conservation of authorities (MM-03.3 §2): the origin of a derived authority exists, and\non each leaf of the derived footprint, the leaf is in the footprint of the origin and the\nderived mode does not exceed the origin's. -/\ndef I2 (s : S3) : Prop :=\n  ∀ (b : Nat) (y : Authority) (a : Nat), s.A[b]? = some y → y.origin = some a →\n    ∃ x : Authority, s.A[a]? = some x ∧ ∀ p ∈ y.footprint, p ∈ x.footprint ∧ y.mode.le x.mode\n\n/-- I3, validity of dependencies (MM-03.3 §2): every anchor of a usable place is valid, that is,\nactive (pass-1 arbitrage 2). -/\ndef I3 (s : S3) : Prop := ∀ q, s.Usable q → ∀ x ∈ s.D q, s.Active x\n\n/-- I4, validity of consumed values (MM-03.3 §2), first sentence as a state predicate: no","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"7746b1f4-fec2-4738-8954-eb4b7fdeab19","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","root":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","branch":"formal/derivability_0.1","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"e0b96dc6-8100-4f56-9977-f241e5100227"