tic`,"]},{"oldStart":98,"oldLines":7,"newStart":99,"newLines":13,"lines":[" precondition fails; `fail`, the state unchanged, when the region is not available (§77.4);"," `reject` when `internal` lacks effective `Modify` on the region (§77.5) or an arrival check fails"," (§77.3, §77.6); `ok` otherwise. The disjointness of §77.5 from the active emissions is not","-restated: it follows from the effective right (`issue_disjoint_redundant`, A11). -/","+restated: it follows from the effective right (`issue_disjoint_redundant`, A11).","+","+Availability is the kernel `Avail`, read leaf by leaf: the kernel keeps `available` as a list of","+leaves, where §46 types it `Set<Region>` and §77.4 tests whether the region belongs to it. The text","+does not settle which reading holds, and the readings classify differently: under the leaf reading a","+region that partly overlaps an active emission fails (§77.4) instead of reaching §77.5, and the","+empty region is always available (`ce_avail_leaf`; report, (f)). -/"," inductive IssueR (ar : Arena) (region : List Nat) (dst : Nat) (s : S3) : IOutcome → Prop where","   | ok : IssueStaticR s ar region dst → Avail ar region → IssueRight s ar region →","       ArrivalR s ar region dst →"]},{"oldStart":164,"oldLines":6,"newStart":171,"newLines":18,"lines":["     | fail s' ar' => exact absurd ho (h2 s' ar')","     | reject => exact ho"," ","+/-- The restricted `issue` on the entry `i` of the state (§77.1, \"L'entrée `arena` existe\"): the","+`IssueR` of the recorded entry, whose new metadata is written back, as the kernel `IssueAt`; a","+missing entry is rejected. -/","+inductive IssueAtR (i : Nat) (region : List Nat) (dst : Nat) (s : S3) : AOutcome → Prop where","+  | ok {ar : Arena} {s' : S3} {ar' : Arena} : s.arenas[i]? = some ar →","+      IssueR ar region dst s (.ok s' ar') → IssueAtR i region dst s (.ok (arenaSet s' i ar'))","+  | fail {ar : Arena} {s' : S3} {ar' : Arena} : s.arenas[i]? = some ar →","+      IssueR ar region dst s (.fail s' ar') → IssueAtR i region dst s (.fail s)","+  | reject {ar : Arena} : s.arenas[i]? = some ar → IssueR ar region dst s .reject →","+      IssueAtR i region dst s .reject","+  | none : s.arenas[i]? = none → IssueAtR i region dst s .reject","+"," /-! ## The kernel sequence for `issue` -/"," "," /-- The authority that `split` of `internal` on `[region]` (O2), or `derive` of `internal` at"]},{"oldStart":1160,"oldLines":9,"newStart":1179,"newLines":10,"lines":["   ⟨reach_run (by decide), by decide, .fail (by decide) (by decide), .ok (by decide),","     .ok (by decide)⟩"," ","-/-- **Empty region**: the restricted `issue` of the empty region is `ok`; no place has an empty","-footprint (`exists_mem_footprint`), so `derive` (O1), which takes a place, cannot produce the block,","-while `split` on one region can (`issue_as_kernel_split`). -/","+/-- **Empty region**: the restricted `issue` of the empty region is `ok` (the empty region is","+available under the leaf reading of `available`, `ce_avail_leaf`); no place has an empty footprint","+(`exists_mem_footprint`), so `derive` (O1), which takes a place, cannot produce the block, while","+`split` on one region can (`issue_as_kernel_split`). -/"," theorem ce_empty_region :","     IssueR arD [] 2 (run K0 [] opsArena).s","       (.ok (issueEffR (run K0 [] opsArena).s arD [] 2).1 (issueEffR (run K0 [] opsArena).s arD [] 2).2) ∧"]},{"oldStart":1172,"oldLines":6,"newStart":1192,"newLines":23,"lines":["   obtain ⟨l, hl⟩ := exists_mem_footprint hw ((run K0 [] opsArena).s.P.length - q + 1) q (by omega) hq","   rw [he] at hl; simp at hl"," ","+/-- The entry of `opsAlloc` once `[5]` is issued into 2 (block 5). -/","+def arLi : Arena := ⟨4, 4, [6], [([5], 5)]⟩","+","+/-- **Leaf reading of `available`** (Q1I-1 of the review): after the emission of `[5]` (block 5,","+active), the region `[5, 6]` partly overlaps the active emission. With `available` read leaf by leaf","+(the kernel `Avail`), it is unavailable and the restricted `issue` fails (§77.4); with `available`","+a set of regions from which only `[5]` left, `[5, 6]` would be available and §77.5 would reject it,","+`internal` lacking the effective right on 5. The empty region is available though `available`","+holds no region of it. -/","+def opsLeaf : List Op := opsAlloc ++ [.issue 0 0 [5] 2]","+","+theorem ce_avail_leaf :","+    Reachable K0 [] (run K0 [] opsLeaf).s ∧ (run K0 [] opsLeaf).s.arenas = [arLi] ∧","+    IssueR arLi [5, 6] 3 (run K0 [] opsLeaf).s (.fail (run K0 [] opsLeaf).s arLi) ∧","+    ¬ IssueRight (run K0 [] opsLeaf).s arLi [5, 6] ∧ Avail arLi [] :=","+  ⟨reach_run (by decide), by decide, .fail (by decide) (by decide), by decide, by decide⟩","+"," /-- **`internal` stored into the arena value** (`reset`): `internal` 4 was placed into the arena"," value 0 by `store` (O8), which adds it to `D 0`. The restricted `reset` and the kernel `reset` are"," rejected by their clause 3 (§78.3, the kernel reading `internal` within its subtree of origins) for"]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal/Ern/Derived/Arena.lean"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"41ff3033-29c4-47ba-a6aa-a9a03f3afe4c","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","root":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","branch":"formal/derivability_0.1","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":1,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":1},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"c64f03ea-3797-4e35-9038-30ccf5135f80","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"co