e","+  destination; `fail` when no room is left;"," * `mark`: a mark (stack, fresh identifier, top), metadata only;"," * `rewind`: the derived `reset` on the cells above the mark, `split` of `internal` on them then","   `release` of the derived authority; `fail` for a mark that is not live in the stack;"," * `grow`: in place, `release` of the last block, then the derived `issue` of a region of the same","-  base and of larger size into the same destination; `fail` when no room is left.","+  base and of larger size into the same destination, which is `Init`; `fail` when no room is left."," "," Every `ok` step of the library takes kernel steps of `Reachable` only (`dexec_reach`). The theorems","-of the brief are `rewind_rejects_live_above`, `mark_no_aba`, `rewind_keeps_older_marks`,","+of the brief are `rewind_rejects_live_above`, `mark_no_aba` (with `rewind_removes`),","+`rewind_keeps_older_marks`,"," `grow_same_base`, `grow_keeps_prefix_init` and `grow_keeps_prefix_bytes` (through the refinement"," `Ern.MM23`, unchanged). The decisions the brief does not settle are listed in the report"," (`formal/reports/Derivability_v0.1.md`, (c) and (f))."]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal/Ern/Lib/DataStack.lean"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"f48adac3-6e9a-446e-aa52-161eeb6a2747","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","root":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","branch":"formal/derivability_0.1","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":2,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":1},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/forma