{"parentUuid":"2ff94f5e-5221-48d7-9eda-593ce92885ba","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CggAw8J6bUvdauHvxQ57d","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Ba6FBgRBL4iGwS8dvniVMU","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd ~/Devlab/ernlang/ern && git add formal/Ern/Derived/Arena.lean formal/Ern/Lib/DataStack.lean formal/reports/Derivability_v0.1.md && git commit -q -m \"Derivability: review fixes and report\n\nWhy: the adversarial review confirmed 12 of 16 findings, one blocking:\nmark_no_aba covered only the rewound mark, not the later marks removed\nwith it.\n\nWhat: MarksWF adds mark uniqueness and mark_no_aba covers every removed\nmark (with rewind_removes); ResetPreR includes liveness and IssueAtR,\nResetAtPreR look the entry up; the leaf reading of availability is\ndocumented with ce_avail_leaf; push checks the static clauses of the\nrestricted issue before fail and grow checks MetaRightM before fail;\ngrow_same_base is stated on the arrival state; docstrings corrected;\ncases case_rewind_reading and case_static_before_fail added. Report\nDerivability_v0.1.md (French) with sections (a) to (f) and the review.\n\nProof: lake build succeeds without warnings; the forbidden-word grep is\nempty; axiom sweep: Arena 159 constants, DataStack 360 constants, nothing\noutside propext and Quot.sound.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\" && git log --oneline -1; echo \"12. Applied review fixes (MarksWF Nodup, general mark_no_aba, rewind_removes, ResetPreR liveness, IssueAtR/ResetAtPreR, ce_avail_leaf, push static per IssueStaticR, grow MetaRightM before fail, grow_same_base on d'.s, docstrings, 2 cases); report written; build/grep/axioms clean (159/86, 360/156); committed.\" >> /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-guygouri-Devlab-ernlang-ern/c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180/scratchpad/d1/log.md","description":"Commit review fixes and report"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"